# Tree version of c4b1_live_board.scn: the real mount over WebRTC (`?signal=`),
# driven through the Graph tools region's "Remote session" section.
#
# `wait` holds while a remote answer is still to come: the join and the mount
# first, then each intent's round trip and the bell-driven resume after it.
wait
assert snap remote-link == webrtc
assert snap remote-state == open
assert snap remote-revision == 1
assert snap remote-cards == 1
click role:button Remote mount
settle 1
assert snap session == remote
assert text Remote projection · 1 objects · revision 1
capture c4b1_mounted
wait
# The endpoint advertises both intents; the section offers one button each.
# The forbidden one is refused, and the revision stands still — measured by
# a resnapshot, since a refusal rings no bell.
assert text Append a card
assert text Forbidden action
click role:button Forbidden action
wait
assert snap action-status ~ Rejected
assert snap remote-revision == 1
assert snap remote-cards == 1
# The admitted one is accepted; the bell it rings drives a resume the host
# answers by diff, and the board shows the second card.
click role:button Append a card
wait
assert snap action-status ~ Accepted
assert snap remote-revision == 2
assert snap remote-cards == 2
assert snap remote-resume ~ diff
assert event remote-bell revision 2
capture c4b1_appended
wait
log c4b1 live board receipt complete
